Edit documents, spreadsheets, presentations and PDFs offline

ONLYOFFICE Desktop Editors is an office suite with a word processor, spreadsheet and presentation editors, a PDF editor and a diagram viewer, all in one tabbed window. It works with Microsoft Office formats (DOCX, XLSX, PPTX) and keeps their layout intact, and it can also connect to cloud storage to edit files together with others.

- Word processor, spreadsheet and presentation editors in one app
- Edit PDFs and create fillable forms
- Works with DOCX, XLSX and PPTX as well as ODF formats
- Connect to Nextcloud, ownCloud, Seafile, Dropbox and other clouds for real-time collaboration
- Digital signatures, password protection and dark mode
- Optional AI assistant that works with the provider of your choice, including local models
